Clock Work Cities is a role-playing game based in a world were science works differently than in our own.   Primarily using the concept of the Either that interferes with the reliable use of combustion for anything.   This means that cars and guns and most forms of electrical generation simply do not work and that even in the locations where they might the use is so marginal it has simply never been developed.   Inventions that we take for granted such as the telegraph, phone and radio simply do not exist. The primary setting for the game will be the great city of Abelanth and based around the 13 ward.  Clockwork cities is a steam punk inspired game of politics and intrigue with just a bit of fisticuffs thrown in for fun.   Players will take on the role of a resident of the 13 Ward.  Most players will be well off Middle Class members of society with some doing a bit better and some much worse.

