The Effects of Stress
Stress is the mechanical tracking of "Biological Debt." Whether caused by being in the wrong en-vironment or eating the wrong food, the penalties are identical and cumulative. All penalties are rounded down.
I. Progressive Impairment (Every 4 Stress)
For every 4 points of accumulated Stress, your character's systems begin to fail:
•	Stat Penalty: -1 to ALL Stats (Primary, Secondary, and Tertiary).
•	Vigor Penalty: -1 to Max Health Pool.
•	Example: At 8 Stress, you suffer -2 to all stats and -2 to your Max Health.
II. Systemic Collapse (Every 10 Stress)
For every 10 points of accumulated Stress, your body undergoes severe breakdown under the fol-lowing condition:
Note: Daily damage from Systemic Collapse only occurs if the current environment or food source is 2 or more shifts away from your Native (Shift 0) base.
•	Degradation: If the condition above is met, you take 1 Level of Damage per day for eve-ry 10 points of Stress.
•	This damage cannot be healed until the Stress is reduced below the 10-point threshold or you return to a more compatible environment/diet (Shift 1 or 0).
Example: A Human (Shift 0) at 12 Stress in the Dark Neither (Shift 2) takes 1 damage/day. That same Human at 12 Stress in a Shift 1 zone takes no daily damage, but still suffers the -3 Stat/Health penalties.
